    "created_at": "2024-07-10T12:05:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-07-10T12:05:35Z",
    "body": "I added @ddworken's [commented risks](https://gist.github.com/yoavweiss/c7b61e97e6f8d207be619f87ab96ead5?permalink_comment_id=5085511#gistcomment-5085511) as a note.\r\nI thought that a \"browser context group switch\" also implied a potentially separate process. @arturjanc - should I understand from your [comment](https://gist.github.com/yoavweiss/c7b61e97e6f8d207be619f87ab96ead5?permalink_comment_id=5092478#gistcomment-5092478) that you'd like to see something more explicit here?",
